                      "name": "Beveiliging",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "gap": "$space-lg",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "b2TuI",
                          "name": "Index",
                          "fill": "$brand",
                          "content": "04",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-caption",
                          "fontSize": "$text-xs2",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "I1TUE",
                          "name": "Text",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": "$space-xs",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "LOZpH",
                              "name": "Heading",
                              "fill": "$foreground",
                              "content": "Beveiliging",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": "$text-lg",
                              "fontWeight": "600"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "o447v5",
                              "name": "Body",
                              "fill": "$muted-foreground",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "•  Tokens en secrets worden versleuteld opgeslagen (AES via de Laravel-encryptielaag).\n•  In logs verschijnen alleen fingerprints (sha256, eerste tekens), nooit rauwe tokens of secrets.\n•  Elke koppeling heeft een eigen webhook-secret; er is geen gedeelde secret.\n•  Al het verkeer loopt over TLS (versleuteld transport).\n•  Strikte multi-tenant-scheiding: elke koppeling hoort bij precies één account bij precies één Consumer; cross-tenant-toegang is technisch afgedwongen.\n•  Toegang tot de productieomgeving is beperkt tot geautoriseerd personeel.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                              "fontSize": "$text-md",
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
